- Add `safety_facts`, optional `ea_roles`, normalized `evidence`, and the full `decision` to `ManifestRoot`; keep existing nodes, edges, and `verdict_hint`.
- Add opt-in EA inference to `build_safety_ir_from_source()`. When disabled, represent EA roles as absent; when enabled but inconclusive, preserve all roles as undetected/low confidence.
- Keep the decision computation based exclusively on existing taint, capability, resource, and policy inputs. EA data will not participate.
- Bump the IR version for the additive schema. No deserializer change is needed because none exists.
- Modify the Safety IR model/builder/exports and its tests. Leave `pipeline.py`, manifest generation/verification, and resource estimation unchanged unless validation reveals a necessary compatibility issue.

